			"value": "title: next/root-params\nnav_title: root-params\ndescription: API Reference for the next/root-params module that provides access to root-level route parameters."
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "The "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "next/root-params"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " module provides getter functions for accessing root-level "
